WEBVTT

1
00:00:06,190 --> 00:00:07,150
You kid is crazy

2
00:00:07,710 --> 00:00:08,750
Come so close

3
00:00:09,230 --> 00:00:11,470
What if your feet get caught in a fishing net and fall into the sea?

4
00:00:11,590 --> 00:00:12,630
That's a fatal thing

5
00:00:13,900 --> 00:00:22,350
Uncle, I was wrong, uncle

6
00:00:22,940 --> 00:00:29,110
There seems to be a pair of sea snakes in this net.

7
00:00:29,510 --> 00:00:30,550
I just saw it

8
00:00:31,030 --> 00:00:34,150
Several sea snakes are twisted together into a big ball

9
00:00:34,310 --> 00:00:35,430
Looks so disgusting

10
00:00:35,670 --> 00:00:39,080
If it's a sea snake

11
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:41,360
Some varieties are really worth some money

12
00:00:51,040 --> 00:00:52,000
Song and Yuan stepped back a little

13
00:00:52,480 --> 00:01:11,910
This isn't a sea snake, it's Uncle Wolf Fan Fan

14
00:01:13,100 --> 00:01:14,580
Why did you chop off their heads?

15
00:01:15,510 --> 00:01:17,150
This kind of wolf-tooth fan blows fiercely

16
00:01:17,730 --> 00:01:18,970
And the attack power is very strong
